# Menagerie is a monorepo but only the app + the public walkthrough are shipped.
# Default-deny everything, then re-include index.html and the walkthrough subtree,
# so a Cloudflare deploy never exposes relay-go/, protocol/, plan/, etc.
/*
!/index.html
# PWA app-shell sidecars (installability): manifest + icons.
!/manifest.webmanifest
!/icon.svg
!/icon-180.png
!/icon-192.png
!/icon-512.png
# Re-include only docs/walkthrough/** (the legacy getting-started + its screenshots).
!/docs
/docs/*
!/docs/walkthrough
!/docs/walkthrough/**
# Re-include the searchable feature guide (built artifact + its screenshots only —
# never the generator .py sources).
!/guide
/guide/*
!/guide/index.html
!/guide/screenshots
!/guide/screenshots/**
